[25.765, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Let me find how Remote Control is enabled and where `claude` actually\r\n"]
[26.665, "o", "  lives — then test the exact invocation before declaring it.\r\n"]
[27.865, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.415, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  docker exec console tmux new-session -d -s claude 'claude --remote-control'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[29.115, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Testing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(48s · ↓ 1.1k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.115, "o", "\r\n"]
[31.665, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Works — Remote Control is live with a session URL. Now to declare it so\r\n"]
[32.565, "o", "  it happens on every boot.\r\n"]
