[104.062, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Yes — that's the core of what Remote Control is for, and it works in\r\n"]
[104.962, "o", "  both directions. Each window the button opens prints a session URL and\r\n"]
[105.862, "o", "  registers with your account.\r\n"]
[106.962, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Open that session in the app and you're driving the same session — same\r\n"]
[107.862, "o", "  conversation, same working directory, same tmux window. It isn't a\r\n"]
[108.762, "o", "  copy: type in the app and the tmux pane updates; type in the pane and\r\n"]
[109.662, "o", "  the app follows.\r\n"]
[111.062, "o", "\r\n"]
[111.612, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mA smart-home button that hires another Claude.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
